    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1504" n="[1470]" xml:id="pg1470"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations
                        of the United States</hi>, 1952–1954. Eastern Europe; Soviet Union; Eastern
                    Mediterranean: <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v08">Volume VIII</ref>. Please be
                    aware that printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#terms">List of Abbreviations and
                                Symbols</ref>, Page XI (date of correction: March 25,
                        2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Duplicate entry for USAF (United States Air Force) has been
                        deleted.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1440 (date
                            of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Typeset command T3 and T1 have been deleted from the entry for Baxter,
                        William O., and the “n” has been italicized.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">3. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1442 (date
                            of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Backwards curly quote has been deleted from the entry for Cyrankiewicz,
                        Josef.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">4. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1443 (date
                            of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Backwards curly quote has been deleted from the entry for
                            DeLany, Walter S.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">5. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1443 (date
                            of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Additional spaces have been deleted between the page numbers from the
                        entry for Davis, Richard H.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">6. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1443 (date
                            of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Additional spaces have been deleted between the page numbers from the
                        entry for Dawson, Laurence A.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">7. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1443 (date
                            of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>The spelling of Laurence A. Dawson’s name has been
                        corrected in index entry for Dawson, Laurence A.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">8. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1444 (date
                            of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>The page number has been corrected in entry for Stalin’s illness and death
                            <hi rendition="#italic">below</hi> the entry for Eisenhower, Dwight
                        D.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">9. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1449 (date
                            of correction: March 26, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Typeset command T3 and T1 have been deleted from the entry for Lovett,
                        Robert A., and the “n” has been italicized.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">10. <ref target="#index">Index</ref>, Page 1455
                            (date of correction: March 22, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>A misplaced comma has been removed and placed within the curly quotes in
                        entry for “Doctors’ Plot” <hi rendition="#italic">below</hi> the entry for
                        Soviet Union.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
